    <briefdescription>
<para>This is the base event type. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It defines an abstract object which represents that an asynchronous event happened.</para>
<para>It is possible to insert a dependency between two events provided the dependency follows the chronological order of creation: an event E2 created after an event E1 cannot depend on E1.</para>
<para>Inserting a dependency between two events is supposed to be a non-blocking operation, but the actual event implementation is allowed to block temporarily. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
